<title>JAPAN: Foreigners neutral on Japan shares via &quot;Big Four&quot;.</title>
<headline>Foreigners neutral on Japan shares via &quot;Big Four&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday showed a net neutral stance, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 7.0 million shares of sell orders against a similar amount of buy orders.</p>
